{
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Act 2: The Bill",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s03b01",
     "shot": "l16_intro",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "His name was Louis XVI.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b02",
     "shot": "l16_profile",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He became king at nineteen, in 1774, and by almost every account he was",
     "date": 1774,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:nineteen,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b03",
     "shot": "l16_profile",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "a decent, well-meaning, slightly awkward man who would rather have been in his workshop.",
     "date": 1774,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:workshop.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b04",
     "shot": "marie",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "His wife was Marie Antoinette, an Austrian princess who arrived in France as a",
     "date": 1770,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "sparkle",
       "w:Marie",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b05",
     "shot": "marie",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "teenager and was disliked at court almost immediately.",
     "date": 1770,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "blip",
       "w:disliked",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b06",
     "shot": "money_host",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Here is how money worked in his kingdom.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:money",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b07",
     "shot": "estates",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "French society was split into three groups, called estates.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:three",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b08",
     "shot": "estates",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The clergy were the first.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:clergy",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b09",
     "shot": "estates",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The nobility were the second.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:nobility",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b10",
     "shot": "estates",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Everyone else, about 98 percent of the country, was the Third Estate.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:Everyone",
       0.7
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b11",
     "shot": "estates",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And the first two were largely exempt from the biggest direct tax.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:exempt",
       0.8
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b12",
     "shot": "estates",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "So the richest people in the kingdom paid the least,",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       "w:paid",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b13",
     "shot": "estates",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and the poorest paid the most.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       "w:most.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b14",
     "shot": "america",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Then the king made it worse by backing the American Revolution, to hurt Britain.",
     "date": 1778,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "swish",
       0,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b15",
     "shot": "america",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "France helped America win independence, which cost more than a billion livres,",
     "date": 1783,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       "w:billion",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b16",
     "shot": "america",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and in exchange got bankruptcy.",
     "date": 1783,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "deflate",
       "w:bankruptcy.",
       0.7
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b17",
     "shot": "interest",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "By the 1780s roughly half the royal budget was going on interest alone.",
     "date": 1786,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:half",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b18",
     "shot": "interest",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "That's like spending half your salary on the minimum payment on a credit card, forever.",
     "date": 1786,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:forever.",
       0.7
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b19",
     "shot": "blocked",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Finance ministers tried to fix it by taxing the privileged.",
     "date": 1786,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b20",
     "shot": "blocked",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Every single time, the privileged blocked it.",
     "date": 1786,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slam",
       "w:blocked",
       0.8
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b21",
     "shot": "notables",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In 1787 the king even called an Assembly of Notables to approve reforms,",
     "date": 1787,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b22",
     "shot": "notables",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "and they said no.",
     "date": 1787,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boom",
       "w:no.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b23",
     "shot": "locked_system",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "So the system was locked: the people with money wouldn't pay,",
     "date": 1787,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:locked:",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b24",
     "shot": "locked_system",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and the people without money couldn't.",
     "date": 1787,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:couldn't.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b25",
     "shot": "hail",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Then nature piled on.",
     "date": 1788,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       0,
       0.6
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b26",
     "shot": "hail",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In July 1788 a freak hailstorm destroyed crops across northern France.",
     "date": 1788,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       "w:hailstorm",
       0.7
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b27",
     "shot": "winter",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Then came one of the coldest winters anyone could remember.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b28",
     "shot": "bread_bar",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Grain collapsed, bread prices spiked, and by the summer of 1789,",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       "w:collapsed,",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b29",
     "shot": "bread_bar",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "by some estimates, a labourer was spending up to 88 percent of his wages on bread alone.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "impact",
       "w:88",
       0.7
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b30",
     "shot": "cake",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And no, Marie Antoinette never said 'let them eat cake.' That line appears in",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:never",
       0.7
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b31",
     "shot": "cake",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Rousseau's Confessions, written when she was a child in Austria.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:Confessions,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b32",
     "shot": "feels_true",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "It was a story people told about out-of-touch royals long before she arrived.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       8,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b33",
     "shot": "feels_true",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "It stuck because it felt true.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b34",
     "shot": "feels_true",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And in a crisis, what feels true often matters more than what is.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b35",
     "shot": "asks_people",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "By 1788 the king was out of options,",
     "date": 1788,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b36",
     "shot": "asks_people",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "so he did something no French king had done for 175 years.",
     "date": 1788,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:175",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b37",
     "shot": "asks_people",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He asked the people.",
     "date": 1788,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:people.",
       0.6
      ],
      [
       "paper",
       "w:people.",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b38",
     "shot": "dynasty_end",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He had no idea he was calling the meeting that would end his dynasty.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drone",
       0,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "crack",
       "w:end",
       0.6
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "tension"
    }
   ],
   "mood": "curious"
  }
 ]
}